```text
frontend/src/app/
├── platform-admin/              Platform Admin tenant console
├── tenant-admin/                Tenant Admin members and assignments
├── admin/                       Compatibility redirect to /tenant-admin
├── documents/
│   └── procedures/new/          Level 2 procedure form prototype
└── page.tsx                     Main dashboard

backend/src/
