├── prisma/                      Prisma service and database access
├── app.controller.ts            Backend health endpoint
└── app.module.ts                Root NestJS module

prisma/
└── schema.prisma                Shared root Prisma schema
```

The structure is organized around product domains. The CEO/MD approval experience should be added under `frontend/src/app/documents/approvals/`, because approval is a document workflow rather than a separate organizational administration area.

